  "notes": "{進|すす}める means to advance, move forward, or promote something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pair: {進|すす}む (intransitive - to advance, proceed)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {計画|けいかく}を{進|すす}める: to advance a plan\n- {話|はなし}を{進|すす}める: to move the discussion forward\n- {準備|じゅんび}を{進|すす}める: to proceed with preparations\n- {仕事|しごと}を{進|すす}める: to move work forward\n- {交渉|こうしょう}を{進|すす}める: to advance negotiations\n\nHOMOPHONE DISTINCTION:\n- {進|すす}める: to advance, promote\n- {勧|すす}める: to recommend\n- {薦|すす}める: to recommend (person)",
